 requirements, so please refer to your prospective department for details.\nOnline application form\n$50 non-refundable application fee\nOfficial transcripts (unofficial transcripts are acceptable for application review)\n2 letters of recommendation\nPersonal statement\nResume/CV\nEnglish language proficiency, if applicable\nPlease review the full language proficiency policy for testing options and minimum score requirements.\nApplication\nMailing Address\nIf you are mailing application materials, please send them to:\nLehigh University College of Arts & Sciences\nOffice of Research & Graduate Programs\n9 West Packer Avenue\nMaginnes Hall, Suite 490\nBethlehem, PA 18015\nLehigh College of Arts & Sciences school code -- 2365\nReady to Apply?\nComplete an online application.\nApply Now\nDeadlines\nThese are College of Arts & Sciences deadlines, but please refer to your prospective department for program-specific details. In addition to admissions requirements, some departments have application deadlines and enrollment terms that differ from the College.\nNovember 1\nApply for Spring Semester\nJanuary 1\nApply for Fall Semester (with financial aid consideration)\nApril 1\nApply for Summer Session\nJune 30\nApply for Fall Semester (financial aid may not be available)\nConnect with Us\nCollege of Arts and Sciences\n9 West Packer Avenue,\nBethlehem,\nPA 18015\nincas@lehigh.edu\n610-758-3300\nFooter Navigation\nUndergraduate\nMajors & Minors\nGet Started\nAcademics\nCurrent Students\nGraduate\nDegrees\nAdmissions\nCurrent Students\nArts\nAlumni\nGO Campaign\nGiving Opportunities\nHow to Make a Gift\nLeadership\nSupport Staff\nConnect with Us\nCollege of Arts and Sciences\n9 West Packer Avenue,\nBethlehem,\nPA 18015\nincas@lehigh.edu\n610-758-3300\nFooter Navigation\nUndergraduate\nMajors & Minors\nGet Started\nAcademics\nCurrent Students\nGraduate\nDegrees\nAdmissions\nCurrent Students\nArts\nAlumni\nGO Campaign\nGiving Opportunities\nHow to Make a Gift\nLeadership\nSuppor